swarm_service_at_desired{com_example_team="payments",display_name="web api",service="api",service_mode="replicated",stack="web"} 0
# HELP swarm_service_desired_replicas Number of desired replicas for a Swarm service (replicated: configured replicas; replicated-job: total completions; global and global-job: eligible nodes).
